  "description": "DAVPEZ crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H66 N6 O78 Tb12,6(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1A (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2A (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1B (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2B (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1O (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2O (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1P (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2P (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1Q (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2Q (Tb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.662-3.838 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.32-109.61°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb12(HL)6(L)6(NO3)6(H2O)12]·6H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 12 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
